  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increasing adaptive capacity of local communities, ecosystems and hydroelectric systems in the R o Blanco upper watershed with a focus on Ecosystem and Community Based Adaptation and Integrated Adaptive Watershed Management.</narrative>
